sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as RouteSearchUI
  participant LS as LocationService
  participant RC as RouteCalculator
  participant API as ApiClient
  participant SM as StorageManager
  User->>UI: 출발지/도착지 입력
  UI->>LS: searchStations(keyword)
  LS->>API: request(searchStation, params)
  API-->>LS: 좌표 포함 역 후보 목록
  LS-->>UI: List~Station~
  UI->>UI: showAutoComplete(candidates)
  User->>UI: 역 선택 (origin, dest 확정)
  UI->>RC: searchRoutes(origin, dest)
  RC->>API: request(searchPubTransPathT, params)
  API-->>RC: 경로 데이터
  RC->>RC: sortByTransfer(routes)
  RC-->>UI: List~Route~
  UI->>SM: addRecent(station)
  UI-->>User: 추천/대체 경로 표시
